# fixture-source-repo: synthetic
# fixture-scope: a workspace glob whose ERE the grep on PATH cannot compile (`[z-a]`, a descending range) is untranslatable, not "no match" (issue #475).
# fixture-content: a TAB-separated body follows the path only where the CONTENT decides the derivation (the root package.json's `workspaces` key).
# ---8<--- one tracked path per line below; optional TAB-separated content
bun.lock
package.json	{"workspaces": ["packages/*", "!packages/[z-a]"]}
packages/a/package.json
packages/b/package.json
